We're thrilled to announce Cardmaniacs 1.0 — the reading app we always wanted, now available on the App Store.

## What's included

- Full RSS & Atom feed support with card-based layout
- Read Later with specialized parsers for JS-heavy sites, GitHub, and Wikipedia
- Bookmark manager with tags, smart folders, and full-text search
- PDF, EPUB, and Markdown document support
- iCloud Sync across macOS, iOS, and iPadOS
- Vim-style keyboard navigation
- Widgets & Shortcuts integration
- Spotlight search for saved content
